Example 1: Self-Driving Car 🚗

Imagine a self-driving car driving on a busy road.

The AI camera sees:

🚗 Car
🚌 Bus
🚶 Person
🚲 Bicycle
🚦 Traffic Signal
What YOLO Does
Car → Detected
Person → Detected
Bus → Detected

YOLO only tells:

"There is a car here."

What Mask R-CNN Does
Car → Detected + Exact Shape
Person → Detected + Exact Shape
Bus → Detected + Exact Shape

Mask R-CNN tells:

"This exact green area belongs to the car."

This helps the car know exactly where the object starts and ends.

Example 2: Swiggy / Zomato Delivery Robot 🤖

A delivery robot sees:

Road
Person
Bike
Dog

Mask R-CNN separates each object.

Road = Blue
Person = Green
Bike = Red
Dog = Yellow

The robot can safely move around obstacles.

Example 3: Hospital MRI Scan 🏥

Doctor uploads a brain scan.

Normal Object Detection
Tumor Found
Mask R-CNN
Tumor Found
Exact Tumor Boundary Highlighted

Doctors can measure the tumor size accurately.

Example 4: Mobile Phone Gallery 📱

You take a family photo.

Mask R-CNN identifies:

Father
Mother
Child
Dog

Each object is separated from the background.

This is how many photo editing apps remove backgrounds automatically.

Example 5: Amazon Warehouse 📦

A camera sees:

Box A
Box B
Box C

Boxes may overlap.

Mask R-CNN identifies the exact boundary of each box.

Robots can then pick the correct package.
